---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Process
permalink: /process/
description: Diagnose where work breaks, design the operational system, build and integrate it, then launch, observe and improve it.
---

<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="hero__grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero3d hero3d--low" data-hero3d data-detail="low" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shell" style="position:relative;z-index:1">
    <span class="label label--signal">Process</span>
    <h1 class="h1" style="margin-top:1rem">How the work runs</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      Four steps, in that order, every time. The first one is the one most
      projects skip, and it is the reason the other three go wrong.
    </p>
    <div class="pagehead__meta">
      {% for step in process %}<span class="label label--faint">{{ step.title }}</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band section">
  <div class="shell">
    <ol class="proc">
      {% for step in process %}
        <li class="proc__step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 80 }}">
          <div class="proc__num">{{ loop.index0 | pad }}</div>
          <div class="proc__body">
            <h2 class="h2">{{ step.title }}</h2>
            <p class="lede" style="margin-top:.85rem">{{ step.lede }}</p>
            <p class="body" style="margin-top:1rem">{{ step.detail }}</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="proc__meta">
            <div><dt>You get</dt><dd>{{ step.output }}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Takes</dt><dd>{{ step.duration }}</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{# ================================================= THE DIAGNOSIS ======= #}
<section class="band band--dark section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="label">Step one, in detail</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__rule"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__lead">
        <h2 class="h2">Five questions I ask of every operation I am brought into.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
          The website diagnostic runs a structural version of this on your
          public site in about a minute. It is a useful first read, not a
          substitute for the full week.
        </p>
        <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem">
          <a class="btn" href="/start/">Start a project <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-open-diagnostic>
            Run a diagnostic <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split__body">
        <div class="chain">
          {% for step in method %}
            <div class="chain__step" data-status="{{ step.status }}" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 90 }}">
              <span class="chain__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div class="chain__head">
                <div>
                  <span class="label label--plain label--faint">{{ loop.index0 | pad }}</span>
                  <div class="chain__title">{{ step.title }}</div>
                  <div class="chain__desc">{{ step.desc }}</div>
                </div>
                <span class="chip" data-status="{{ step.status }}">{{ step.status }}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__lead">
        <h2 class="h2">What this is not</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="split__body">
        <ul class="needlist">
          <li>Not a redesign of your website with a form on the end.</li>
          <li>Not a vendor tool you rent and reshape your team around.</li>
          <li>Not a reveal at the end. You see working software every week from step three.</li>
          <li>Not finished at launch. It is finished when it is how work gets done.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem">
          <a class="link" href="/about/">Who is doing the work <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
